{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "00c52f6a-3548-80d8-b274-26cddd097940",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:58:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Morning, or just about afternoon, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:53:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah? Hi, Kevin? I'm calling about the bus stop on my street? It's completely buried in plowed snow? [pause] Sorry, I've got you on speaker, I'm carrying groceries in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:53:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Which street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:53:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pelham Street? I'm at 288 Pelham, up on the Hill? The stop is right out front, practically in front of my house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:54:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 288 Pelham Street. Got it. So the plow came through and pushed a bank right over the stop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes? After the storm? The snow-to-rain thing, Sunday into Monday? So it's this heavy, wet, icy pile now? And it's just a wall? Nobody can get to the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:54:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that wet stuff turns to concrete. Is anybody actually waiting there, like people trying to get on the bus?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:54:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, they're standing in the street? Which is, you know, great? I saw a woman with a stroller out there this morning, in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:54:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, not great. Let me write this down. Bus stop, 288 Pelham, buried by plow bank, people standing in the roadway. Anything else, like is it on a corner or mid-block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:55:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mid-block? Kind of near the cross street, but mid-block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:55:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mid-block, got it. And that's the one with the bus sign on the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:55:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes? The sign's sticking out of the snow, like halfway? So when is somebody going to come clear it? Because I've been looking at it since yesterday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:55:29-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the crews are still working through the cleanup after that storm. Roads came first, and now they're going back for things like bus stops and corners. I'd say you're looking at a day or two, maybe a bit more depending on how many other spots are on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:55:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two? Okay? That's, um, kind of a long time? Because it's going to freeze tonight? And then it's a block of ice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's true, it'll be harder to move once it freezes. I'll flag it as a safety thing since people are in the street. That might bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:16-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? Thank you? My friend says there's a trick to this, though? She says if you call the right way you don't have to wait in the long line for these things? Do you know what she means?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:33-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know about a trick. Calling in with the exact location and what the hazard is, like you just did, is about the best way. That's what gets it on the list properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh? So there's no secret number or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, you got the secret number. It's this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? Well, she's always saying stuff like that? Anyway, it's just kind of annoying? Because it's the same every time? They plow, and then we get the pile?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:10-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear that a lot. The plows have to put the snow somewhere, and the stops take the hit. Do you want me to put a callback number on this, in case the crew needs to confirm the spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure? It's 401-555-0156?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-six. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right? That's it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I've got 288 Pelham Street, bus stop buried by the plow bank, mid-block near the cross street, pedestrians in the road. I'll send it over now marked as a safety issue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? And you really think a day or two? Not like, next week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd expect it by Thursday or so. If it's still there Friday, call me back and we'll push it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? Fine? Thanks, Kevin? I'll look for them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Enjoy the groceries, and watch your step on that ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do? Bye?"
    }
  ],
